.TH ICOM7300MK2CONTROL 1 "September 2026" "1.2.12" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
Icom7300Mk2Control \- control an Icom IC-7300MK2 and a LAN Quansheng client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B Icom7300Mk2Control
.SH DESCRIPTION
Qt 6 graphical application for radio control, meters, spectrum, memories
and Morse training. Icom CI-V and Quansheng LAN connections are independent.
Configure connections from the application. The Quansheng server runs on
the computer physically connected to the UV-K5.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/Icom7300Mk2/Icom7300Mk2Control.conf
User preferences, preserved during package upgrades and removal.
.SH NOTES
Serial access requires the user's normal device permissions, usually membership
of the dialout group. Run the application as your regular user.
External programs such as DECODIUM, fldigi, QSSTV and JS8Call are installed separately.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qdock-server-gui (1),
.BR qdock-server (1)
.PP
.I /usr/share/doc/icom7300mk2-control/INSTALAR.md
